   "text": "choice / noul / score shapes assembled by the server.\nconfidence = (p − 1/n) / (1 − 1/n) — that is peakedness,\nnot correctness.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "choice / noul / score shapes assembled by the server.\nconfidence = (p − 1/n) / (1 − 1/n) — that is peakedness,\nnot correctness.",
